{
  "category": "Tender Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "MILOTIC is said to be the most beautiful of all the POKéMON. It has the power to becalm such emotions as anger and hostility to quell bitter feuding.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "MILOTIC live at the bottom of large lakes. When this POKéMON’s body glows a vivid pink, it releases a pulsing wave of energy that brings soothing calm to restless spirits.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said to live at the bottom of large lakes. Considered to be the most beautiful of all POKéMON, it has been depicted in paintings and statues.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "MILOTIC is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "MILOTIC is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "When people bicker, it is said to arise from the depths of lakes to becalm violent hearts.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is the world’s most beautiful Pokémon. There are many works of art featuring MILOTIC.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s said that a glimpse of a MILOTIC and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
